"ARIA is your AI property assistant powered by Claude. It has context about your tasks, finances, and documents, so you can ask it anything about your home." = "ARIA is your AI property assistant powered by Claude. It has context about your tasks, finances, and documents, so you can ask it anything about your home.";
"Go to Settings → My Property → tap the + button. Fill in the address, type, and optional photo. You can manage multiple properties from the same account." = "Go to Settings → My Property → tap the + button. Fill in the address, type, and optional photo. You can manage multiple properties from the same account.";
"When creating a task, toggle 'Recurring' and choose a frequency (daily, weekly, monthly, yearly). The task will auto-recreate after completion." = "When creating a task, toggle 'Recurring' and choose a frequency (daily, weekly, monthly, yearly). The task will auto-recreate after completion.";
"The Health Score (0–100) is calculated from overdue tasks, expiring documents, and maintenance frequency. Complete tasks and renew documents to improve it." = "The Health Score (0–100) is calculated from overdue tasks, expiring documents, and maintenance frequency. Complete tasks and renew documents to improve it.";
"Yes. Go to your Profile → Security & Privacy → Export My Data. You'll get a JSON file with all your tasks, finances, documents, and more." = "Yes. Go to your Profile → Security & Privacy → Export My Data. You'll get a JSON file with all your tasks, finances, documents, and more.";
"Yes — all data is stored in Supabase (PostgreSQL) with automatic daily backups. Your data is safe even if you change devices." = "Yes — all data is stored in Supabase (PostgreSQL) with automatic daily backups. Your data is safe even if you change devices.";
"Yes. Go to Settings → Family Members → tap the invite icon. Enter their email — they'll receive a link to join your property." = "Yes. Go to Settings → Family Members → tap the invite icon. Enter their email — they'll receive a link to join your property.";
